{
  "book": "mosiah",
  "bookName": "Mosiah",
  "chapter": 4,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 584.702,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.805,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, it came to pass that when king Benjamin had made an end of speaking the words",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.985,
      "end": 9.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which had been delivered unto him by the angel of the Lord,",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 9.787,
      "end": 13.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he cast his eyes round about on the multitude,",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 13.264,
      "end": 15.586,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold they had fallen to the earth,",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.766,
      "end": 18.367,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the fear of the Lord had come upon them.",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 19.047,
      "end": 22.53,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they had viewed themselves in their own carnal state,",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 22.71,
      "end": 24.986,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even less than the dust of the earth.",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 25.166,
      "end": 28.092,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they all cried aloud with one voice, saying:",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 28.272,
      "end": 29.665,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O have mercy,",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 29.845,
      "end": 32.167,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and apply the atoning blood of Christ",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 32.347,
      "end": 35.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we may receive forgiveness of our sins,",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 35.638,
      "end": 37.867,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and our hearts may be purified;",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 38.047,
      "end": 40.137,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for we believe in Jesus Christ,",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 40.317,
      "end": 41.664,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Son of God,",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 41.844,
      "end": 43.98,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who created heaven and earth,",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 44.16,
      "end": 45.367,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all things;",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 45.547,
      "end": 48.658,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who shall come down among the children of men.",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 49.338,
      "end": 52.635,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after they had spoken these words",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 52.815,
      "end": 55.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Spirit of the Lord came upon them,",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 55.363,
      "end": 57.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were filled with joy,",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 57.447,
      "end": 60.187,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having received a remission of their sins,",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 60.367,
      "end": 63.525,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and having peace of conscience, because of the exceeding faith",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 63.705,
      "end": 70.764,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which they had in Jesus Christ who should come, according to the words which king Benjamin had spoken unto them.",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 71.444,
      "end": 74.416,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And king Benjamin again opened his mouth",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 74.596,
      "end": 76.964,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to speak unto them, saying:",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 77.144,
      "end": 78.955,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My friends and my brethren,",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 79.135,
      "end": 80.9,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my kindred and my people,",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 81.08,
      "end": 83.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would again call your attention,",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 83.536,
      "end": 87.391,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may hear and understand the remainder of my words",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 87.571,
      "end": 89.429,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which I shall speak unto you.",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 90.109,
      "end": 93.592,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, if the knowledge of the goodness of God at this time",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 93.772,
      "end": 97.209,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "has awakened you to a sense of your nothingness,",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 97.389,
      "end": 100.083,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and your worthless and fallen state\u2014",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 100.763,
      "end": 102.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 102.429,
      "end": 105.68,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if ye have come to a knowledge of the goodness of God,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 105.86,
      "end": 109.25,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his matchless power, and his wisdom, and his patience,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 109.43,
      "end": 112.634,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his long-suffering towards the children of men;",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 112.814,
      "end": 118.619,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also, the atonement which has been prepared from the foundation of the world,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 118.799,
      "end": 121.585,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby salvation might come to him",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 121.765,
      "end": 123.948,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that should put his trust in the Lord,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 124.128,
      "end": 127.425,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and should be diligent in keeping his commandments,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 127.605,
      "end": 130.902,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and continue in the faith even unto the end of his life,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 131.082,
      "end": 133.358,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I mean the life of the mortal body\u2014",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 134.038,
      "end": 144.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say, that this is the man who receiveth salvation, through the atonement which was prepared from the foundation of the world for all mankind,",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 144.481,
      "end": 147.082,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which ever were since the fall of Adam,",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 147.262,
      "end": 148.33,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or who are,",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 148.51,
      "end": 152.086,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or who ever shall be, even unto the end of the world.",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 152.766,
      "end": 155.367,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this is the means whereby salvation cometh.",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 155.547,
      "end": 160.47,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there is none other salvation save this which hath been spoken of;",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 160.65,
      "end": 163.947,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither are there any conditions whereby man can be saved",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 164.127,
      "end": 166.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except the conditions which I have told you.",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 167.268,
      "end": 168.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Believe in God;",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 168.795,
      "end": 170.281,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "believe that he is,",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 170.461,
      "end": 172.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that he created all things,",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 172.917,
      "end": 174.96,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both in heaven and in earth;",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 175.14,
      "end": 178.344,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "believe that he has all wisdom, and all power,",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 178.524,
      "end": 180.567,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both in heaven and in earth;",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 180.747,
      "end": 185.437,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "believe that man doth not comprehend all the things which the Lord can comprehend.",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 186.117,
      "end": 189.461,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, believe that ye must repent of your sins",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 189.641,
      "end": 191.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and forsake them,",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 191.214,
      "end": 193.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and humble yourselves before God;",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 193.762,
      "end": 197.291,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ask in sincerity of heart that he would forgive you;",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 197.471,
      "end": 199.886,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and now, if you believe all these things",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 200.066,
      "end": 201.645,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "see that ye do them.",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 202.325,
      "end": 205.019,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again I say unto you as I have said before,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 205.199,
      "end": 208.496,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that as ye have come to the knowledge of the glory of God,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 208.676,
      "end": 211.184,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or if ye have known of his goodness",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 211.364,
      "end": 213.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have tasted of his love,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 213.541,
      "end": 216.235,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have received a remission of your sins,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 216.415,
      "end": 219.944,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which causeth such exceedingly great joy in your souls,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 220.124,
      "end": 222.678,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so I would that ye should remember,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 222.858,
      "end": 225.134,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and always retain in remembrance,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 225.314,
      "end": 226.847,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the greatness of God,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 227.027,
      "end": 228.745,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and your own nothingness,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 228.925,
      "end": 232.036,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his goodness and long-suffering towards you,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 232.216,
      "end": 233.841,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unworthy creatures,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 234.021,
      "end": 235.6,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and humble yourselves",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 235.78,
      "end": 237.963,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even in the depths of humility,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 238.143,
      "end": 240.511,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "calling on the name of the Lord daily,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 240.691,
      "end": 244.174,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and standing steadfastly in the faith of that which is to come,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 244.354,
      "end": 246.722,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was spoken by the mouth of the angel.",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 247.402,
      "end": 249.445,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, I say unto you",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 249.625,
      "end": 251.343,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that if ye do this",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 251.523,
      "end": 253.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall always rejoice,",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 253.421,
      "end": 255.604,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be filled with the love of God,",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 255.784,
      "end": 258.663,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and always retain a remission of your sins;",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 258.843,
      "end": 263.348,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye shall grow in the knowledge of the glory of him that created you,",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 263.528,
      "end": 266.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or in the knowledge of that which is just and true.",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 267.319,
      "end": 270.338,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And ye will not have a mind to injure one another,",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 270.518,
      "end": 272.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but to live peaceably,",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 272.184,
      "end": 276.317,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to render to every man according to that which is his due.",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 276.997,
      "end": 280.898,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And ye will not suffer your children that they go hungry, or naked;",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 281.078,
      "end": 284.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither will ye suffer that they transgress the laws of God,",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 284.927,
      "end": 287.992,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and fight and quarrel one with another,",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 288.172,
      "end": 291.098,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and serve the devil, who is the master of sin,",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 291.278,
      "end": 296.386,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or who is the evil spirit which hath been spoken of by our fathers,",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 296.566,
      "end": 299.074,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he being an enemy to all righteousness.",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 299.754,
      "end": 304.166,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But ye will teach them to walk in the ways of truth and soberness;",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 304.346,
      "end": 306.668,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye will teach them to love one another,",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 306.848,
      "end": 308.706,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to serve one another.",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 309.386,
      "end": 314.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also, ye yourselves will succor those that stand in need of your succor;",
      "verse": "4:16",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 314.303,
      "end": 318.297,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye will administer of your substance unto him that standeth in need;",
      "verse": "4:16",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 318.477,
      "end": 323.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye will not suffer that the beggar putteth up his petition to you in vain,",
      "verse": "4:16",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 323.533,
      "end": 325.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and turn him out to perish.",
      "verse": "4:16",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 325.838,
      "end": 327.463,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Perhaps thou shalt say:",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 327.643,
      "end": 330.383,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The man has brought upon himself his misery;",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 330.563,
      "end": 332.467,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I will stay my hand,",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 332.647,
      "end": 335.108,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and will not give unto him of my food,",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 335.288,
      "end": 339.003,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor impart unto him of my substance that he may not suffer,",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 339.183,
      "end": 341.18,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for his punishments are just\u2014",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 341.86,
      "end": 343.671,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I say unto you, O man,",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 343.851,
      "end": 347.613,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whosoever doeth this the same hath great cause to repent;",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 347.793,
      "end": 351.09,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and except he repenteth of that which he hath done",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 351.27,
      "end": 353.035,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he perisheth forever,",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 353.215,
      "end": 355.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hath no interest in the kingdom of God.",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 356.449,
      "end": 358.817,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, are we not all beggars?",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 358.997,
      "end": 362.387,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Do we not all depend upon the same Being, even God,",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 362.567,
      "end": 368.372,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for all the substance which we have, for both food and raiment, and for gold, and for silver,",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 368.552,
      "end": 371.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and for all the riches which we have of every kind?",
      "verse": "4:19",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 372.436,
      "end": 374.201,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, even at this time,",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 374.381,
      "end": 376.424,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye have been calling on his name,",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 376.604,
      "end": 379.112,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and begging for a remission of your sins.",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 379.292,
      "end": 382.357,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And has he suffered that ye have begged in vain?",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 382.537,
      "end": 385.416,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nay; he has poured out his Spirit upon you,",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 385.596,
      "end": 388.382,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and has caused that your hearts should be filled with joy,",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 388.562,
      "end": 391.302,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and has caused that your mouths should be stopped",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 391.482,
      "end": 393.85,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye could not find utterance,",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 394.03,
      "end": 396.398,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so exceedingly great was your joy.",
      "verse": "4:20",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 397.078,
      "end": 398.564,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, if God,",
      "verse": "4:21",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 398.744,
      "end": 400.323,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who has created you,",
      "verse": "4:21",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 400.503,
      "end": 403.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "on whom you are dependent for your lives",
      "verse": "4:21",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 403.33,
      "end": 405.373,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and for all that ye have and are,",
      "verse": "4:21",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 405.553,
      "end": 408.85,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "doth grant unto you whatsoever ye ask that is right,",
      "verse": "4:21",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 409.03,
      "end": 411.77,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in faith, believing that ye shall receive,",
      "verse": "4:21",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 411.95,
      "end": 415.944,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O then, how ye ought to impart of the substance that ye have one to another.",
      "verse": "4:21",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 416.624,
      "end": 422.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if ye judge the man who putteth up his petition to you for your substance that he perish not,",
      "verse": "4:22",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 422.795,
      "end": 424.002,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and condemn him,",
      "verse": "4:22",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 424.182,
      "end": 428.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "how much more just will be your condemnation for withholding your substance,",
      "verse": "4:22",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 428.588,
      "end": 430.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which doth not belong to you",
      "verse": "4:22",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 430.533,
      "end": 431.833,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but to God,",
      "verse": "4:22",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 432.013,
      "end": 434.103,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to whom also your life belongeth;",
      "verse": "4:22",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 434.283,
      "end": 436.094,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and yet ye put up no petition,",
      "verse": "4:22",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 436.274,
      "end": 439.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor repent of the thing which thou hast done.",
      "verse": "4:22",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 439.973,
      "end": 441.459,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you,",
      "verse": "4:23",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 441.639,
      "end": 443.218,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wo be unto that man,",
      "verse": "4:23",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 443.398,
      "end": 445.72,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for his substance shall perish with him;",
      "verse": "4:23",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 445.9,
      "end": 449.011,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and now, I say these things unto those who are rich",
      "verse": "4:23",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 449.191,
      "end": 451.745,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as pertaining to the things of this world.",
      "verse": "4:23",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 452.425,
      "end": 454.329,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, I say unto the poor,",
      "verse": "4:24",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 454.509,
      "end": 457.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye who have not and yet have sufficient,",
      "verse": "4:24",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 457.522,
      "end": 459.937,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye remain from day to day;",
      "verse": "4:24",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 460.117,
      "end": 462.532,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I mean all you who deny the beggar,",
      "verse": "4:24",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 462.712,
      "end": 464.384,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because ye have not;",
      "verse": "4:24",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 464.564,
      "end": 466.886,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would that ye say in your hearts",
      "verse": "4:24",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 467.066,
      "end": 469.852,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that: I give not because I have not,",
      "verse": "4:24",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 470.032,
      "end": 471.704,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but if I had I would give.",
      "verse": "4:24",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 472.384,
      "end": 474.52,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, if ye say this in your hearts",
      "verse": "4:25",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 474.7,
      "end": 476.325,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye remain guiltless,",
      "verse": "4:25",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 476.505,
      "end": 478.409,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "otherwise ye are condemned;",
      "verse": "4:25",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 478.589,
      "end": 480.911,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and your condemnation is just",
      "verse": "4:25",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 481.091,
      "end": 483.877,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for ye covet that which ye have not received.",
      "verse": "4:25",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 484.557,
      "end": 488.319,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, for the sake of these things which I have spoken unto you\u2014",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 488.499,
      "end": 493.654,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that is, for the sake of retaining a remission of your sins from day to day,",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 493.834,
      "end": 496.202,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may walk guiltless before God\u2014",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "start": 496.382,
      "end": 499.772,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would that ye should impart of your substance to the poor,",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "start": 499.952,
      "end": 502.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every man according to that which he hath,",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "start": 502.779,
      "end": 504.822,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "such as feeding the hungry,",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 170
    },
    {
      "start": 505.002,
      "end": 506.488,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "clothing the naked,",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 171
    },
    {
      "start": 506.668,
      "end": 508.108,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "visiting the sick",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 172
    },
    {
      "start": 508.288,
      "end": 510.564,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and administering to their relief,",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 173
    },
    {
      "start": 510.744,
      "end": 514.366,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both spiritually and temporally, according to their wants.",
      "verse": "4:26",
      "lineIndex": 174
    },
    {
      "start": 515.046,
      "end": 519.04,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And see that all these things are done in wisdom and order;",
      "verse": "4:27",
      "lineIndex": 175
    },
    {
      "start": 519.22,
      "end": 523.957,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it is not requisite that a man should run faster than he has strength.",
      "verse": "4:27",
      "lineIndex": 176
    },
    {
      "start": 524.137,
      "end": 527.341,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, it is expedient that he should be diligent,",
      "verse": "4:27",
      "lineIndex": 177
    },
    {
      "start": 527.521,
      "end": 530.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby he might win the prize;",
      "verse": "4:27",
      "lineIndex": 178
    },
    {
      "start": 530.348,
      "end": 532.624,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, all things must be done in order.",
      "verse": "4:27",
      "lineIndex": 179
    },
    {
      "start": 533.304,
      "end": 538.598,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I would that ye should remember, that whosoever among you borroweth of his neighbor",
      "verse": "4:28",
      "lineIndex": 180
    },
    {
      "start": 538.778,
      "end": 541.332,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should return the thing that he borroweth,",
      "verse": "4:28",
      "lineIndex": 181
    },
    {
      "start": 541.512,
      "end": 543.277,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "according as he doth agree,",
      "verse": "4:28",
      "lineIndex": 182
    },
    {
      "start": 543.457,
      "end": 545.918,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or else thou shalt commit sin;",
      "verse": "4:28",
      "lineIndex": 183
    },
    {
      "start": 546.098,
      "end": 549.953,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and perhaps thou shalt cause thy neighbor to commit sin also.",
      "verse": "4:28",
      "lineIndex": 184
    },
    {
      "start": 550.633,
      "end": 551.98,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And finally,",
      "verse": "4:29",
      "lineIndex": 185
    },
    {
      "start": 552.16,
      "end": 555.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I cannot tell you all the things whereby ye may commit sin;",
      "verse": "4:29",
      "lineIndex": 186
    },
    {
      "start": 555.869,
      "end": 558.284,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for there are divers ways and means,",
      "verse": "4:29",
      "lineIndex": 187
    },
    {
      "start": 558.464,
      "end": 560.693,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so many that I cannot number them.",
      "verse": "4:29",
      "lineIndex": 188
    },
    {
      "start": 561.373,
      "end": 563.416,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But this much I can tell you,",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 189
    },
    {
      "start": 563.596,
      "end": 565.779,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that if ye do not watch yourselves,",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 190
    },
    {
      "start": 565.959,
      "end": 569.117,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and your thoughts, and your words, and your deeds,",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 191
    },
    {
      "start": 569.297,
      "end": 571.805,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and observe the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 192
    },
    {
      "start": 571.985,
      "end": 578.951,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and continue in the faith of what ye have heard concerning the coming of our Lord, even unto the end of your lives,",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 193
    },
    {
      "start": 579.131,
      "end": 580.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye must perish.",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 194
    },
    {
      "start": 580.704,
      "end": 582.283,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, O man,",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 195
    },
    {
      "start": 582.463,
      "end": 584.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "remember, and perish not.",
      "verse": "4:30",
      "lineIndex": 196
    }
  ]
}